<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">quests</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">quests</ansi> command lists the quests you are working on. Each one shows
its name, a progress bar, and what to do for your current step.

Finished quests are hidden. Add <ansi fg="command">all</ansi> to list them too.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">quests</ansi>              Show the quests you are working on
  <ansi fg="command">quests all</ansi>          Show every quest you have started, finished ones too

Stuck on a step? <ansi fg="command">hint</ansi> gives a nudge for your current quest, and
<ansi fg="command">hint [name]</ansi> gives one for a quest you name.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help hint</ansi>
